%% Daily Diary 日記エントリ状態遷移
%% MVP では「下書き」「公開」の区別なし。状態は実質「存在」「更新済」「削除済」のみ。
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Created : POST /api/diary-entries
    Created --> Edited : PUT /api/diary-entries/{date}
    Edited --> Edited : 何度でも編集可能
    Created --> Deleted : DELETE /api/diary-entries/{date}
    Edited --> Deleted : DELETE /api/diary-entries/{date}
    Deleted --> [*] : 物理削除（復元不可）

    note right of Created
      created_at = now()
      updated_at = created_at
    end note
    note right of Edited
      updated_at が更新される
      created_at は不変
    end note
